Z||000000||RobH||05-17-2000||10:33 PM||||Well, after posting the question about the reliability between Auto's and Manuals...I bought the 86 SE.  I really really like it, the V6 does make quite a bit of difference.<P>This forum is just Awesome! My Brother and Dad both are amazed at how fast people respond here on this forum.<P>She needs 2 new tires and good cleaning, but other than that (so far) she is just fine.  Looking through the records I found where EGR Valve had been replaced, recall work has been done, etc.<P>Are "Holley" brand Throttle Bodies standard on the 2.8 V6?  My bro doesn't seem to think so, but thought I'd ask.<P>Again, thanks for the advice,<BR>Rob||||reg||1
