Z||000003||theogre||05-17-2000||10:54 PM||||Holley has produced a number of OEM parts. You'd have to measure the inside diameter to see if it's stock. (Holley made the 2 stage/2 barrel carb used by Ford for all the 2.3l OHC motors used in Pinto, mustang, and other cars. This particullar carb was a holley license Webber design as I recall. One of the most solid carbs I've ever owned.)||||reg||1
